# Machine-specific profiling outputs (do not commit)
# These are regenerated by benchmark/benchmark.sh or scripts/run_scaling_benchmarks.py
# and contain hardcoded paths from the dev machine that ran them. Keep them
# out of the tree so the repo doesn't accumulate stale 1-shot snapshots.
perf.data*
*.out
*.log
hyperfine.md
perf-*.txt
time-*.txt
scaling_results.json
scaling_results.md
